    "Tuji 的招牌功能！對準身邊的物品拍一張，AI 幫你把它變成單字卡。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tuji's signature feature! Point your camera at something nearby and AI turns it into a flashcard."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tujiの目玉機能！身の回りの物にカメラを向けて撮るだけで、AIが単語カードにしてくれます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tuji 的招牌功能！对准身边的物品拍一张，AI 帮你把它变成单字卡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tuji 的招牌功能！建立帳號後，對準身邊的物品拍一張，AI 幫你把它變成單字卡。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tuji's signature feature! Once you have an account, point your camera at something nearby and AI turns it into a flashcard."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tujiの目玉機能！アカウントを作れば、身の回りの物にカメラを向けて撮るだけで、AIが単語カードにしてくれます。"
          }
        },
