    "高精度識別會用更強的 AI 重新辨識，適合普通識別認錯或不確定的物件，準確度更高。" : {
      "comment" : "Detail message in a prompt that explains the benefits of using high precision for identifying items.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "High-precision re-recognizes with a stronger AI — best when Standard got it wrong or unsure, for higher accuracy."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "高精度認識はより強力なAIで再認識します。通常認識が誤認識した物や不確かな物に適しており、精度が高くなります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
